  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 reached end of support on June 1st, 2026, and no longer receives updates, including security fixes. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. This release adds a notification manager for events in repositories, build projects, deployments, and pipelines. You can now configure rules and receive notifications about events that occur for resources. Each notification includes a status message as well as a link to the resource (repository, build project, deployment application, or pipeline) whose event generated the notification.",
